# Line endings are set once here, not in each clone or runner (issue 357).
# A plain clone on the PC must read the same bytes as the oracle: LF for the
# code and data the rules and Godot read, CRLF for Windows batch files because
# cmd needs them. core.autocrlf is not consulted for these paths.
*.js   text eol=lf
*.gd   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
